{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Rook Pack delivers brute force in style with four fearsome weapon skins \u2014 Steampunk Hammer, Shipbreaker Cannon, Treant Cleaver, and Pit Fighter Gauntlets. Rule the battlefield in the unyielding Runeforged Outfit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pack contains:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >o\tRook Cosmetic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >o\tRuneforged Outfit - The garb of a Runeforged, a Soulforged imbued with magic by Nimue. She neglected to mention how the process affected the skin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >o\tHammer cosmetic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >o\tSteampunk Hammer \u2013 A strange hammer of unknown origin. While it feels heavy, it swings with uncanny ease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\t Cannon cosmetic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >o\tShipbreaker Cannon \u2013 A cannon stripped from wreckage in Deep Harbor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tHalberd cosmetic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >o\tCleaver Halberd \u2013 An axe built to rend the Treants that walk the forests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\t Gauntlets cosmetic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >o\tPit Fighter Gauntlets \u2013 To make a living in the fighting pits, you have to be both brutal and clever.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3756810?t=1758643471","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3756810?t=1758643471","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756810/1caecf5a81e80332308e8f5a13c65aa6e81097b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758643471","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756810/1caecf5a81e80332308e8f5a13c65aa6e81097b5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758643471","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Download